   \frac{\partial U}{\partial r} = \frac{2}{\pi} \cdot \frac{1}{\left( \frac{2r \sin \theta}{1 - r^2} \right)^2 + 1} \cdot \frac{2 \sin \theta}{1 - r^2} \cdot (-2r) = \frac{2}{\pi} \cdot \frac{1}{\frac{4r^2 \sin^2 \theta}{(1 - r^2)^2} + 1} \cdot \frac{-4r \sin \theta}{1 - r^2}.
