\[
\Delta E \geq 1.03 \times 10^{-22} \times 10^{6}\text{ MeV} \approx 1.03 \times 10^{-16}\text{ MeV}
\]

Thus, the uncertainty in the energy is \(1.03 \times 10^{-16}\text{ MeV}\).

The typical range of outcomes for the measurement of the Σ⁺ rest energy would be:

\[
1385 \text{ MeV} \pm 1.03 \times 10^{-16}\text{ MeV}
