\[
\text{Percentage Change} = \left( \frac{A_{vf}' - A_{vf}}{A_{vf}} \right) \times 100\% = \left( \frac{55.56 - 111.11}{111.11} \right) \times 100\% = \left( \frac{-55.55}{111.11} \right) \times 100\% \approx -50\%
