   \[
   P_{\text{ambient}} = P_{\text{water source}} + P_{\text{depth}}
   \]
   The pressure due to the water surface is the height of the water surface (1 meter) times the density of the water (1000 kg/m$^3$) times the gravitational acceleration (9.81 m/s$^2$).
